    doi: 10.5281/zenodo.22711457
    notes: Parent harness from which experiment I-1's receiver, marker and probe are derived.
abstract: >-
  Reproducible Docker/Python harness for the controlled single-mechanism
  independence experiment of Paper 1A (H2): removal of Interface, Execution
  Pathway and Authority in turn from one fixed mechanism, each by an ordinary
  control, with the two unaffected conditions independently verified and a
  sham control for the harness itself.
keywords:
  - cybersecurity
  - ablation
  - reproducibility
  - interface
  - execution pathway
  - authority
